flowchart LR
  accTitle: DOT-Design system context and supported runtime mappings
  accDescr: DOT authors combine capabilities, contracts, anchors, service bindings, configuration, and runtime declarations in dot.json. DOT-Repository co-versions definitions, the generated schema, and high-level skill classifications; dotx validates the reusable definition, and a separate composition pins instances and wires. The dotx lifecycle layer deploys Docker images, Docker Compose, Kubernetes manifests, Helm charts, Vagrantfiles, and SHA-256-pinned WebAssembly modules through Wasmtime and WASI.

  subgraph DesignTime["1–2 · Reusable model, validation, discovery, and composition"]
    direction TB
    Authored["Author-owned DOT model<br/><br/>Skills · Contracts<br/>Anchors · service-port bindings<br/>Runtimes · deployments · services · configuration"]
    Dot[("dot.json<br/>portable source of truth")]
    Authored --> Dot

    Schema["DOT-Repository/Schema<br/>JSON Schema 2020-12"] -.->|constrains| Validation["dotx validate<br/>schema + domain relationships"]
    Repository[("DOT-Repository<br/>DOTs · Skills · Schema")]
    Document["Composition document<br/>pinned DOT instances · wires<br/>inputs · dependencies · exposures"]
    Compose["dotx compose<br/>validate · inspect · apply<br/>status · destroy"]

    Dot -->|validated as one DOT| Validation
    Dot -->|reviewed and versioned| Repository
    Dot -.->|identity and version pinned| Document
    Document --> Compose
    Validation -->|validated definition| Compose
    Repository -->|repository URI resolution| Compose
  end

  subgraph Execution["3 · Selected deployment and runtime execution"]
    direction TB
    Adapters["dotx lifecycle adapters<br/>deploy · start · stop · status · destroy"]
    Docker["Docker platform<br/>Docker Image · Docker Compose<br/>docker · docker compose"]
    Kubernetes["Kubernetes platform<br/>Kubernetes Manifest · Helm Chart<br/>kubectl · helm"]
    Vagrant["Vagrant platform<br/>Vagrantfile<br/>vagrant · provider-managed VM"]
    Wasm["WebAssembly platform<br/>WASM Module · WASI CLI/HTTP<br/>wasmtime"]
    Native["Platform-native resources<br/>workloads · services · endpoints · live state"]

    Adapters --> Docker
    Adapters --> Kubernetes
    Adapters --> Vagrant
    Adapters --> Wasm
    Docker --> Native
    Kubernetes --> Native
    Vagrant --> Native
    Wasm --> Native
  end

  DesignTime -->|selects a compatible deployment| Execution

